INFO - 2026-03-17 10:05:51,228 - social.agent - Agent 8 performed action: quote_post with args: {'post_id': 41, 'quote_content': 'Let’s push back on this Goldman Sachs bullish thesis: TSMC’s 3 weeks of extra wafer inventory does not fully mitigate prolonged Middle East geopolitical disruptions, which will directly erode NVIDIA’s Q1 2025 revenue. Minority cloud provider capacity locks do not negate that 80% of 2025 planned AI GPU capacity is already secured — this means AI hardware oversaturation is not years away, it’s imminent in 2025. Most critically, Dynamo 1.0 is a free open-source platform that adds non-revenue-generating R&D overhead, and the space computing initiative will not deliver meaningful top-line growth until the 2030s at the earliest; there is no material margin upside to offset these costs. This bullish price target upgrade ignores these hard, near-term headwinds that will crush NVIDIA’s valuation in the coming quarters. #NVDABear #ContrarianMarkets'}
